        "TileImage": "$($repository 08c3b5e8-8aff-4306-a9f9-eaeb076b22a9).Image",
        "Description": "Priest Padre Francesca has contact the ICA to eliminate 3 of his church staff. They have accepted large amounts of illegal money from the mafia to negatively influence the people of sapienza.\r\rUnfortunately for Francesca, the ICA has also got a hit contract on him.\r\rTake out the church staff and make it look like an accident 47, eliminate Francesca by any means necessary, but don&apos;t let his body be found until after you leave.\r\rI will leave you to prepare\rGood luck 47",
